&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems.

The job is equal parts technical and strategic: you&#39;ll architect the data model and automations, size pipeline coverage, and build the forecast leadership runs on.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the GTM tech stack end to end: HubSpot, its integration to NetSuite, and the BI layer on top.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect the CRM data model so every deal is structured for clean reporting and revenue recognition (contract type, legal entity, revenue segment, probability of win).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stand up the pipeline-to-backlog-to-revenue bridge across entity, contract type, and product line.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect contract awards to delivery with a milestone tracker that feeds the revenue recognition schedule.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enforce data quality at the point of entry through validation and automation, using modern tooling like n8n and Clay.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep data flowing across CRM, ERP, product catalog, and analytics through integrations you build and maintain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build the forecasting and pipeline models, and the executive and board reporting that runs on them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Put data governance and an audit-ready trail in place for a clean month-end close and external or DCAA audits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain multi-entity, multi-currency workflows in the systems: entity attribution, intercompany flags, consistent FX logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across finance, supply chain, operations, engineering, and the GTM team to align the full deal-to-delivery motion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standardize pipeline stages and qualification criteria with objective exit signals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead enablement and change management as new processes and tools roll out, and earn the trust of sellers, finance, and leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
